{"unit_id":"lubaiUwU__DSH-WeChatClawBot#feature-1","repo":"lubaiUwU/DSH-WeChatClawBot","commit":"b817fc974677a4d53a6061a08d80ddfd6fb84ecb","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"DSH-WeChatClawBot 的功能「扫码登录与验证码」：悬浮球面板可向网关请求登录二维码，展示供手机微信扫描；若微信要求验证，用户可在面板输入手机显示的验证码并提交。","source":"generated","evidence":["dsh-client-wechat-ui/client.js:243-281"]}
{"unit_id":"lubaiUwU__DSH-WeChatClawBot#feature-2","repo":"lubaiUwU/DSH-WeChatClawBot","commit":"b817fc974677a4d53a6061a08d80ddfd6fb84ecb","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"DSH-WeChatClawBot 的功能「微信消息桥接」：网关接收微信文本事件后交给 DSH agent 处理，并将已生成的回复发回原微信联系人；消息使用独立的微信会话键，不进入 GUI 当前会话。","source":"generated","evidence":["dsh-wechat-bot/index.js:231-251"]}
{"unit_id":"lubaiUwU__DSH-WeChatClawBot#feature-3","repo":"lubaiUwU/DSH-WeChatClawBot","commit":"b817fc974677a4d53a6061a08d80ddfd6fb84ecb","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"DSH-WeChatClawBot 的功能「切换微信对话」：用户可在微信发送 /new、/新对话 或 /新会话，也可点击悬浮球中的“新对话”；插件递增并保存会话编号，后续消息进入新的对话上下文。","source":"generated","evidence":["dsh-wechat-bot/index.js:175-177"]}
{"unit_id":"lubaiUwU__DSH-WeChatClawBot#feature-4","repo":"lubaiUwU/DSH-WeChatClawBot","commit":"b817fc974677a4d53a6061a08d80ddfd6fb84ecb","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"DSH-WeChatClawBot 的功能「选择微信回合模型」：悬浮球面板可从可用模型中选择或填写 provider 与模型，并设置思考强度；保存的覆盖配置会持久化，并用于后续微信回合。","source":"generated","evidence":["dsh-client-wechat-ui/client.js:393-495"]}
